Ciri's follow-up that she'd like to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:17.840
a unicorn herself one day is a reference to how&nbsp;
unicorns really do exist in The Witcher universe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

